  "items": [
    {
      "id": "mistral",
      "title": "Mistral Large 4 开放改进版权重",
      "titleId": "mistral-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "月初公测后，Mistral 开放改进版多模态权重，支持文本、图片、工具调用和百万 token 上下文。",
          "variant": "dek"
        },
        {
          "text": "自托管多一个选择，但约 1 万亿总参数并非消费级单卡目标；Hugging Face 的 2-bit 部署示例使用 512GB 统一内存。模型即服务业务另有许可限制。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-29",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 29 日发布",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "Mistral 公告",
          "url": "https://mistral.ai/it/news/mistral-large-4-oss/",
          "icon": true
        },
        {
          "label": "部署说明",
          "url": "https://huggingface.co/blog/mistral-large4",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "security",
      "title": "伪装成小模型的挖矿后门",
      "titleId": "security-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Pluto 报告 31 个恶意模型仓库，通过用户允许执行仓库自定义代码，在权重加载前植入矿工或后门。活动始于 9 月，含关联仓库的 3.2 万余次是下载量而非感染人数。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "尝试陌生模型要审查自定义代码、固定审查过的版本并隔离运行，扫描安全不等于代码可信。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-29",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 29 日研究披露",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "Pluto 研究报告",
          "url": "https://pluto.security/blog/hugging-face-malware-campaign-load-mine/",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "swift",
      "title": "社区 Swift 工具扩充本地语音与分类",
      "titleId": "swift-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "AnySpeechRecognizer 接入本地 Parakeet、Qwen3-ASR 并加入说话人分离；AnyDecisionModel 输出带概率的分类结果，适合录音整理与消息分类。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "作者目前仅在 macOS 27 测试语音包，未验证 iPhone；Qwen 后端更适合文件转写，分类置信度也不等于正确率。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-29",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 29 日社区介绍",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "作者说明",
          "url": "https://huggingface.co/blog/anydecisionmodel",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "granite",
      "title": "Granite Switch 4.1.1 更新适配器",
      "titleId": "granite-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "IBM 公布向后兼容补丁，更新语音识别和 Decision 适配器，底座权重不变。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "做语音转任务、分类服务可关注模块化升级；这是整合更新，并非当天首次推出语音模型。第三方 Adapter SDK 仍在准备中。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-29",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 29 日公告",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "IBM 公告",
          "url": "https://huggingface.co/blog/ibm-granite/granite-switch-4-1-1",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claude",
      "title": "Claude 用量与成本统计 API 进入 Beta",
      "titleId": "claude-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Console 与 Enterprise 组织可按模型、工作区、API key 或调用身份拆解费用，便于定位高成本自动化。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "旧接口仍支持；新数据通常 4 小时内刷新、最长 24 小时，适合账单分析，不宜当实时熔断依据。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-29",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 29 日 Beta 发布",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "发布说明",
