          "icon": true
        },
        {
          "label": "API 文档",
          "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/manage-claude/usage-cost-analytics-api",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gemini",
      "title": "Gemini 4 Carbon 公布，尚未全面开放",
      "titleId": "gemini-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Google 重点强调长流程编程和安全防御，先向部分安全团队与可信伙伴开放。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "个人开发者暂不宜按已上线安排迁移；能力和安全提升属于厂商报告，非独立实测。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-28",
